{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0534_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6957aff5530a1d7ef46cd1bedf492f1227b206c04841f57ca37b42da5a324acc", "ja": "あとでみんなにも、紗代子の反応を伝えとくよ。", "zh": "之后我也会把纱代子的反应转达给大家的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
