{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0534_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "08021666e008d70427569b8fbca106aca2aa53d7ee6e4546efbeaceb48c6da02", "ja": "これまで、たくさんの衣装を着てきましたけど、\nいつも嬉しくなるのはなんでだろうって。", "zh": "到目前为止，我穿过很多套服装，\n可每次都会感到开心，这是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0534_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "b15a16309a95d6c3dd2c86ea0efb21234027b908bd8b363faa4d26f9763f49bd", "ja": "でも、{$P$}の言葉を聞いて、\nちょっと納得しました。", "zh": "不过，听了{$P$}的话，我有点明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0534_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "0fd5fac4d83f735b02cf14068574a3fc78fc1f1b4b517a17b70edb59be332c77", "ja": "衣装に携わってくれた人が私のために作ってくれた\nその思いを感じるんだと思います。", "zh": "我想，是因为我能感受到为我参与服装制作的人，怀着为我而做的那份心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0534_1010_p", "source_sha256": "41a1e3f6c7bb8755cefaa079e966c1494e75860e0e9ca1e1c391b5b34c70c83d", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。いやー、『君想いBirthday』の\n曲と歌詞を研究した甲斐があったな！", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。哎呀——看来研究《君想いBirthday》的曲子和歌词真是有收获啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0534_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "4ebce322a5b6fe53bc6455a62ed56849f8911fd7cf928b6142a86e35068f2639", "ja": "……誕生日？\nああっ！　この感じ、誕生日と似てるかもしれません！", "zh": "……生日？\n啊！这种感觉，说不定和生日很像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0534_1012_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
